      "filename": "Castle Château Kalmar Suède Sweden - photo picture image photography (9586502122).jpg",
      "title": "File:Castle Château Kalmar Suède Sweden - photo picture image photography (9586502122).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/Castle_Ch%C3%A2teau_Kalmar_Su%C3%A8de_Sweden_-_photo_picture_image_photography_%289586502122%29.jpg",
